WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.469
-In honor of the start
of summer grilling season,

00:00:03.469 --> 00:00:05.438
Tariq and I
had a friendly competition

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:07.974
to see who could make
the best barbecue.

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:11.777
It's the first annual --
First annual.

00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:13.712
We're assuming
we're gonna do this again.

00:00:13.712 --> 00:00:16.249
The first annual
"Tonight Show Barbecue-Off,"

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:18.917
And after our --
We had a dip-off.

00:00:18.917 --> 00:00:21.320
Then we had a cake-off
competition earlier this year.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.756
It all comes down to this,
really.

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:23.822
-Yeah.
-This is what it's all about.

00:00:23.822 --> 00:00:25.024
The rules are simple.

00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:26.826
We each had to make
a barbecue dish.

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:30.830
No hot dogs or hamburgers,
and, also, two sides.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.966
Whoever makes the best
overall plate is the winner

00:00:33.966 --> 00:00:37.737
and gets their name engraved on
the Barbecue-Off Golden Spatula.

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:43.276
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:45.311
Earlier, Tariq and I
made our barbecue,

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:47.046
and we recorded the whole thing.

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:49.148
Check this out.
Right on the roof.

00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:51.150
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:55.889 line:0%
♪♪

